  "method": "Real entrance canvas/controller at deterministic frames by queuing only its requestAnimationFrame tick callback. Native layout and fonts remain active; original timeline, renderer, shapes and state are exercised. Exact canvas draw operation coordinates verify unchanged geometry; alpha hashes are recorded only, because color-dependent antialias rounding can change a few alpha bytes.",
  "limits": "Map import deliberately blocked; no new unit tests, no physical device or screen reader check. Controls outside the scanner are verified separately.",
  "validationNote": "All32 browser frame records were captured in the preserved run. The initial color assertion required an exactly opaque Royal Pink pixel even on a1.5px antialiased beam. Validation was corrected to require the exact computed token and a painted pixel within3 RGB units, then all16 comparisons were recomputed from the recorded frames without reloading or changing the application. Exact draw coordinates are unchanged. First assertions and screenshots are preserved.",
